$ File model.e2k exported by StructuralAIAgent (chat 3D frame) - units kN, m
 
$ PROGRAM INFORMATION
  PROGRAM  "ETABS"  VERSION "16.2.1"  

$ CONTROLS
  UNITS  "KN"  "M"  "C"  
  TITLE1  "StructuralAIAgent"  
  TITLE2  "3-storey RC frame 2x2 bays"  
